/**
 * Maps Scryfall Oracle Tag slugs (from the Tagger community project, see
 * ../storage/tagIndex.ts) to one of a small set of deckbuilding function categories.
 *
 * Generated by walking each root tag's full child_ids subtree in Scryfall's oracle-tags
 * bulk data (https://api.scryfall.com/bulk-data/oracle_tags) and collecting every descendant
 * slug under that root's category name. Root tags used, in the order applied (later roots win
 * ties, so more specific roots like "sweeper" or "burn" override the broader "removal"):
 * ramp, removal, sweeper, draw, tutor, counterspell, protection, recursion, discard, lifegain,
 * burn, bounce, sacrifice-outlet, copy, extra-turn, counters-matter.
 *
 * Not auto-refreshed — Scryfall's tag *taxonomy* (which slugs exist and how they nest) changes
 * rarely, unlike the per-card taggings themselves, which tagIndex.ts already keeps fresh live.
 * Regenerate by re-walking the bulk data if new root tags are wanted or Scryfall reorganizes
 * the hierarchy.
 */
